us, human-verified redundancy, not through closed-loop automation. We must mandate that any AI system deployed at a scale exceeding 10^25 floating-point operations undergoes an independent, third-party safety audit that is legally binding and transparent to the public. This shift from reactive, liability-based models to proactive, pre-deployment verification provides the necessary institutional guardrails to prevent irreversible civilizational harm.",
